# Everything is left out of the image unless it is listed below with "!". Listing what to
# include is safer than listing what to leave out, because a new private file (a key, a local
# database, a .env) is excluded without anyone having to remember it.
*

# What the image needs: the pinned packages, the test settings, the code, the settings file,
# the committed data, the committed run summary, and the two JSON files the season and
# profiles tests compare against.
!requirements.txt
!pytest.ini
!config/
!src/
!tests/
!data/
!results/
!frontend/src/data/

# Files Python and macOS make by themselves, even inside the folders above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
